# Riftburst Hellion (Disguise {4}{R/G}{R/G}): each hybrid symbol of the disguise cost is paid with either red or green mana (CR 107.4e, 702.168d). One face-down Hellion is turned face up with {4} from Mox Jets and two red, the other with {4} and two green; the pool is empty right after each. No green is in the pool when red pays and no red when green pays, so a cost with a plain {R} or {G} in place of either hybrid symbol is refused one of the two times.

